  "Multiplying by w turns you by its heading and stretches you by its distance from the harbor.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "The conjugate flips the sign of the imaginary part. On the map, it is a mirror across the Real Road.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
